# ADR 0180: the app-update public key (minisign, as `tauri signer generate` writes it: base64 of the .pub file), on
# the first line that isn't a comment. qrtz verifies every self-update archive against it; it is NOT the module root,
# index or timestamp key.
#
# TODO(ADR 0180): no key yet, so this build can't update itself ("updates aren't set up yet") and app-release.yml
# refuses to publish. On the release Mac, run `scripts/ci/setup-secrets.sh app-update`: it makes the key pair in
# ~/.qrtz-keys/app-update.key, sets the APP_UPDATE_KEY secret and writes the public key into this file. Commit it.
